.--------------------=[ MAIL MAIN MENU HELP PAGE]=----------------------------.
|                                                                             |
|  D - download new mail                                                      |
|  U - upload your replies to BBS. You can send only your replies, if you     |
|      try to upload other packet by mistake please inform sysop 'cause       |
|      sysop will see it in mail_log_file and he might take it as a hack      |
|      attempt.                                                               |
|  R - Resume mail packet, if you had lost your last downloaded mail packet   |
|      you can resume transfer and download it again. (Every time you         |
|      download a packet he is saved so you can resume it later again if      |
|      you had losted, deleted or something else).                            |
|  S - in this menu you can select from which message base to download mail   |
|      from. (see help page in that menu for more INFO)                       |
|  L - in this menu you can set your LastReadPointers                         |
|      (for more INFO see help page in that menu)                             |
|  C - setup your mail configuration                                          |
|      (for more INFO see help page in that menu)                             |
|  H - see this help page (in any menu by pressing 'H' you'll receive         |
|      a HELP_PAGE for that menu                                              |
|                                                                             |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'
